---
date: 2025-06-09T00:00:00-04:00
---

Cagley is a town at the foot of Mount Cagley. Children had gone missing, and the town set a curfew. The disappearances were the work of a shadow creature, the [[Terror of Cagley]] lairing at the bottom of an old mine under the mountain, down a hole with a ramp, past runes and the bodies of the children it had taken. Among the clothes left strewn about the lair was a blouse tagged FF, for Fandra Fiddlesticks. A group of local children went into the mine and destroyed it, and the cavern collapsed as they fled. The town was left unhaunted, and the children, by their own account, in a great deal of trouble when they got home.

The creature will reform in thirty years.
